  "prompt": "For each month of 2025, what net revenue did Voltmarkt's stores in the Netherlands, Belgium and Luxembourg take? Use the store's own country (stores.country_code 'NL', 'BE' and 'LU'), not the country an order ships to. The webshop, store 99, has country_code 'NL' in stores, so it counts as an NL store. Order dates are UTC days. Return four columns, in this order: month (the first day of the month), nl_revenue_eur, be_revenue_eur and lu_revenue_eur. A country with no sales in a month shows 0. Return one row for each month of 2025 with sales. Any row order is fine.",
